SystemRequirements: METIS graph partitioning library (optional; enables nested-dissection sparse ordering for large relationship matrices, auto-detected at configure time, falls back to AMD ordering when absent), NVIDIA GPU toolkit with cuBLAS and cuSOLVER (optional; enables GPU kernels on Linux through SOMMER_CUDA_HOME; the GPU libraries are loaded dynamically at run time and are not needed to build the package)
